# RailFlow Frontend Environment Variables

# In development: Leave unset or empty to use Vite's built-in /api proxy (target: http://localhost:3001)
# On Netlify Free: Leave unset or empty. Netlify automatically proxies /api/* to Render via netlify.toml / _redirects
# On Cloudflare Pages:
# Option 1 (Cloudflare Edge Proxy): Leave unset and set BACKEND_API_URL in Cloudflare Pages Dashboard
# Option 2 (Direct CORS): Set to your Render backend API base URL:
# VITE_API_BASE_URL="https://railflow-af7e.onrender.com/api"
VITE_API_BASE_URL=""
